course: dictionary
lesson: 3098
title: One word, many meanings: eggshell
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: Some words have more than one meaning. Eggshell can be a noun or an adjective, and it can mean different things. The hard cover of an egg is an eggshell. «DDT made their eggshells thin» tells you the shell can be thin and break easily.
explain: The words around a word are its context, and they show you which meaning to use. «The colour of an eggshell depends on the hen's breed, not on how healthy the egg is.» Here eggshell is a colour, not a cover. Ask which meaning fits, then try it in the sentence.
explain: Some words belong to a phrase, and the phrase has its own meaning. «Walking on eggshells» does not mean walking on real shells. It means being very careful not to upset someone who gets angry or hurt easily.
fact: An eggshell is the hard, thin outer cover of an egg, and it breaks easily.
fact: Eggshell is also a very pale off-white colour, like the inside of an egg's shell.
fact: Eggshell paint has a soft, slightly shiny finish.
fact: «Walking on eggshells» means being very careful not to upset someone.
fact: Eggshell is calcium carbonate, which fizzes in vinegar.
exercise: «DDT made their eggshells thin.» Which of these is an eggshell? | *The hard, thin outer cover of an egg | Plates for dinner | A bird's nest made of twigs | A type of shiny paint
exercise: «The walls were painted a soft eggshell white.» What is eggshell here? | *A very pale off-white colour | The hard cover of an egg | A kind of tall tree | A loud, crashing noise
exercise: Mia says, "Dad is walking on eggshells today." What does it mean? | He is making an omelette | He is walking across broken egg shells | *He is being very careful not to upset anyone | He is painting the kitchen floor
test: «Eggshell is calcium carbonate; in vinegar it fizzes away over days.» What is eggshell made of? | Sugar and water | Iron | Plastic | *Calcium carbonate
test: «The colour of an eggshell depends on the hen's breed, not on how healthy the egg is.» What does the colour depend on? | *The hen's breed | The day of the week | How healthy the egg is | The size of the nest
exam: «He chose eggshell paint for his bedroom wall.» What is eggshell paint? | The hard cover of an egg | *Paint with a soft, slightly shiny finish | A very loud noise | A bird's nest
